# Project Compass (Pulse PMO)

Repo `project_TrackerPro`. Product name **Pulse PMO**. Backend project/namespaces: **PMS.API**.

## Stack (current — ignore older FastAPI wiki drafts)

- Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, TanStack Start/Router, Tailwind, shadcn. Dev: `http://localhost:6002`
- Backend: ASP.NET Core 10, EF Core 10, PostgreSQL 16 (`trackerpro`). Dev: `http://localhost:5194` (`/swagger`)
- Auth: JWT access (memory) + rotating HttpOnly refresh cookie. Permissions via `[RequirePermission]`, not role strings on controllers.

